OL,3,CChalmers misses out on medal
OL,5,FAlastair Chalmers has missed out on a
OL,6,Fpodium spot in the Men's 400m Hurdles
OL,7,FFinal at the Commonwealth Games.
OL,9,FThe 26-year-old finished sixth with a
OL,10,Ftime of 50.24 seconds - meaning he
OL,11,Fmissed out on the chance to win
OL,12,FGuernsey's first medal at this year's
OL,13,FGames.
OL,15,FWhilst he started out strong, Chalmers
OL,16,Fclipped a hurdle with about 200 metres
OL,17,Fto go - losing him ground he then
OL,18,Fcould not make up.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/3
