OL,3,CChalmers misses out on medal
OL,5,FThe race was won by Nigeria's Ezekiel
OL,6,FNathaniel in 48.47 seconds, followed
OL,7,Fby England's Jake Minshull and
OL,8,FJamaica's Assinie Wilson.
OL,10,FChalmers won his heat on Wednesday
OL,11,Fnight with a time of 48.92 seconds -
OL,12,Fbut overall qualified fourth fastest
OL,13,Ffor this evening's final.
OL,15,FIn 2022, Chalmers made history -
OL,16,Fbringing home the island's first-ever
OL,17,Fathletics medal at the Commonwealth
OL,18,FGames when he won bronze.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/3
