OL,3,CChalmers misses out on medal
OL,5,FThis evening's result means he also
OL,6,Fmisses out on becoming the second
OL,7,FGuernseyman to secure back-to-back
OL,8,Fmedals at the Commonwealth Games.
OL,10,FHowever, it's been an otherwise
OL,11,Fsuccessful year for the athlete, who
OL,12,Fclaimed back his his British 400m
OL,13,Ftitle last month - in the same week he
OL,14,Fwelcomed his newborn son.
